{"id": "24854", "revid": "2441334", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=24854", "title": "Northbrook", "text": "Northbrook is a city of 33,000 people (2019) in Illinois. Northbrook's downtown shopping district features boutiques and specialty stores.\nGet in.\nBy car.\nIt is fairly simple to get to Northbrook as it can be accessed by many major roads, including the Tri-State Tollway (I-294) and the Edens Expressway (I-94)\nNorthbrook is about a 20-minute drive from O'Hare International Airport. Ubers and taxis are easy to catch \nBy train.\nIt is served by Chicago's Metra commuter rail, and the Milwaukee District/North Line passes through Northbrook and stops at Northbrook station.\nBy bus.\nBus services are also easy to access in Northbrook, and they can provide a way to get in, and around the city. \nGet around.\nGetting around in Northbrook is very easy by car, as the entire city is connected by roads. Public transit is available as well.\nDo.\nThere are plenty of attractions and things to do in Northbrook."}
{"id": "24856", "revid": "162256", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=24856", "title": "North Brunswick", "text": "North Brunswick is a city in Middlesex County.\nUnderstand.\nNorth Brunswick Township is in Middlesex County, in central New Jersey and is 12.3 square miles. North Brunswick is a very inter-racial community that welcomes all kinds of people. It is a great place to live and to raise a family, as well as a nice relaxing place to visit.\nGet in.\nBy train.\nNew Jersey Transit:\nGet around.\nNorth Brunswick is a pretty big town and there are many options for transportation. You can get around by foot or by bicycle if you\u2019d like, walking may take a long time if you are planning on taking a trip to the opposite side of town (tip: if you are planning on walking or bike riding from the West side of town to the East side you are going to pass major highways as well a set of train tracks, be very careful and if possible find another form of transportation. Your next option to get around town is by car. This is probably the best way to get around town, considering the three major highways and one set of train tracks running through Brunswick, walking or bike riding may be a dangerous choice if you are traveling across town. \nSee.\nThere are not many parts of North Brunswick that people would travel hours to see, but if you do find yourself in North Brunswick, Farrington Lake is a must, and you can\u2019t pass up the short drive to Princeton.\nDo.\nMany parks you can go to:\nTwo annual town festivals:"}
{"id": "24857", "revid": "1423298", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=24857", "title": "North Burkina Faso", "text": "North Burkina Faso is the Sahelian region of Burkina Faso, along the border of Mali and Niger.\nGet in.\nOuahigouya is the point of arrival for those coming from Mali, and has frequent buses from Ouagadougou.\nSee.\nAncient ferrous metallurgy sites.\nFive sites with ancient iron mines and furnaces around Burkina Faso have been listed as a world heritage site. Three of them are in North Burkina Faso (the other two are in the Black Volta Region):"}
{"id": "24861", "revid": "2441334", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=24861", "title": "North Canton", "text": "North Canton is a city in Stark County. Is the former home of The Hoover Company.\nNorth Canton was originally called New Berlin, but, due to anti-German attitudes after WWI, the name was changed in 1918."}
